⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Alvin Maker
node C1 · C1 · ⟦Alvin Maker:C1:1a8e3d⟧

WHO   — Alvin Maker — the seventh son of a seventh son
WHAT  — The Maker — a frontier boy who must learn to build a living City of light against the tide of dissolution, teaching the knack of Making to others while the Unmaker labors to tear it all down.
WHERE — C1 · Card  Framework inputs: The Tales of Alvin Maker  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the world tends toward breaking, and a Maker chooses to mend; because power turned to the self curdles, and only the Maker who serves can hold the Unmaker back; because everyone is born with a knack, but Making is the knack of love.
HOW   — By the doodlebug sense that walks inside wood and stone and flesh, by greensong and the heat of the forge, by reshaping iron and bone and the living world toward wholeness — and by gathering a people to build what one hand cannot.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  A Maker is born of love and a Maker makes — and all that the Unmaker tears down, the Maker builds again.

